        <mxCell id="nOwhH89jEhDG4vviQReH-13" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=3;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 144); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Labels&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 144);&quot;&gt;Labels are required on pods for two reasons:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 144);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Because pod names are auto-generated and not predictable, Deployments and Services use&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: rgb(60, 60, 60); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px; word-break: break-word; font-size: 0.9em; color: rgb(208, 208, 208);&quot;&gt;selector.matchLabels&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;group and select&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;all pods that belong to them across any number of replicas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 144);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;They enable blue/green deployments — a Service&#39;s selector can be flipped between&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: rgb(60, 60, 60); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px; word-break: break-word; font-size: 0.9em; color: rgb(208, 208, 208);&quot;&gt;version: blue&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: rgb(60, 60, 60); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px; word-break: break-word; font-size: 0.9em; color: rgb(208, 208, 208);&quot;&gt;version: green&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to shift traffic between two live Deployments instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="326.49" x="779.51" y="475" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
